---
interface Props {
  title?: string;
  subtitle?: string;
}

const {
  title = "Anatomy of an Automotive Search in 2026",
  subtitle = "One query. Five distinct search surfaces to win. Only one of them is an organic blue link."
} = Astro.props;
---

<div class="hud-panel p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl my-12" style="border-color: var(--color-border); background: var(--color-bg-card);">
  
  <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
    <span class="eeat-badge mb-2">Modern SERP Breakdown</span>
    <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black mt-2" style="color: var(--color-text-primary);">{title}</h3>
    <p class="text-sm mt-2" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">{subtitle}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-start">
    
    <!-- Left Simulated SERP Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-4 font-sans text-xs">
      
      <!-- Search Input -->
      <div class="p-3 rounded-xl border flex items-center gap-3" style="background: var(--color-bg-surface); border-color: var(--color-border);">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-400 shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="11" cy="11" r="7" /><path d="m16.2 16.2 4.3 4.3" />
        </svg>
        <span class="font-mono text-slate-200 text-xs">brake repair cost 2023 ford f150</span>
      </div>

      <!-- 1. Google AI Overview -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border relative" style="background: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.08); border-color: rgba(108, 92, 231, 0.4);">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[11px] text-purple-400">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-purple-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">1</span>
            ✦ Google AI Overview
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-purple-500/20 text-purple-300">Position Zero</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-slate-200 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Front brake pad & rotor replacement for a 2023 F-150 averages $380–$620 per axle. Certified Ford service centers at <mark class="bg-purple-400/20 text-purple-300 font-bold px-1 rounded">yourdealership.com</mark> include electronic parking brake calibration and OEM Motorcraft ceramic pads.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5">
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/40">✓ yourdealership.com (Win)</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-400 border border-white/[0.08]">repairpal.com</span>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-white/[0.04] text-slate-400 border border-white/[0.08]">f150forum.com</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 2. Google Maps 3-Pack -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border relative" style="background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.08); border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4);">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[11px] text-amber-400">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-amber-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">2</span>
            📍 Local Google Maps 3-Pack
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-300">40-60% Clicks</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-2.5 rounded-lg bg-black/40 border border-amber-500/30 flex items-center justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-200">Your Dealership & Service Bay · 4.9 ★★★★★ (482)</div>
            <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-400">Ford Service & Brakes · 1.2 miles away · Open Now</div>
          </div>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded bg-amber-400 text-black font-bold text-[10px] shrink-0">Book Bay →</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 3. Video Carousels -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border relative" style="background: rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.08); border-color: rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.4);">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-2">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[11px] text-red-400">
            <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-red-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">3</span>
            ▶ Video Diagnostic Pack (YouTube &amp; Shorts)
          </div>
          <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-[10px] font-mono bg-red-500/20 text-red-300">Visual Intent</span>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-2">
          <div class="flex-1 p-2 rounded bg-black/40 border border-red-500/20 flex items-center gap-2">
            <span class="text-red-400 text-sm">▶</span>
            <div class="truncate">
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 truncate">F-150 Brake Service Mode Protocol</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">Your Channel · 84k views</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 p-2 rounded bg-black/40 border border-white/[0.06] flex items-center gap-2 hidden sm:flex">
            <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm">▶</span>
            <div class="truncate">
              <div class="font-bold text-slate-200 truncate">Rotor inspection guide</div>
              <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">AutoPro · 32k views</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 4. People Also Ask -->
      <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl border relative" style="background: rgba(34, 193, 220, 0.08); border-color: rgba(34, 193, 220, 0.4);">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[11px] text-cyan-400 mb-2">
          <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">4</span>
          ❓ People Also Ask (PAA) Accordions
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-1 text-slate-300 text-[11px]">
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>How long do OEM Ford F-150 brake pads last?</span>
            <span class="text-cyan-400">+</span>
          </div>
          <div class="p-1.5 rounded bg-black/30 flex items-center justify-between">
            <span>Can you turn/resurface 2023 F-150 rotors?</span>
            <span class="text-cyan-400">+</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- 5. Traditional Organic Blue Link (Dimmed) -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.02] opacity-60">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 font-bold text-[11px] text-slate-400 mb-1">
          <span class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-[10px]">5</span>
          Standard Web Link (The Old #1 Organic Result)
        </div>
        <div class="font-bold text-blue-400 underline">F-150 Brake Specials &amp; Service | Generic Dealership</div>
        <div class="text-[10px] text-slate-400">genericdealership.com › service › brakes</div>
        <div class="mt-2 text-[10px] font-mono text-amber-400/90 flex items-center gap-1">
          <span>↑ 78% of automotive searchers convert on surfaces 1–4 above this link</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Right Strategic Explanation Column -->
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-4">
      
      <div class="hud-panel p-5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-purple-400 mb-1">1. The Answer Slot (AEO)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Sits at the very top of the SERP and quotes verified sources. Earning the citation inside the AI answer box is the new Position #1 in automotive search.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-panel p-5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-amber-400 mb-1">2. Google Maps 3-Pack (Local Intent)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Captures 40% to 60% of high-urgency mobile repair and showroom walk-in traffic. Requires multi-department GBP hierarchy and geo-grid conquest.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-panel p-5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-red-400 mb-1">3. Video Diagnostic Carousel</h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Google extracts short-form and long-form video solutions for diagnostic and fitment queries. A single video can rank simultaneously on Google, YouTube, and TikTok.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-panel p-5">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-cyan-400 mb-1">4. People Also Ask Network</h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          Captures secondary buyer objections (maintenance intervals, warranty coverage). We deploy structured <code>FAQPage</code> schema to own multiple accordion slots.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-panel p-5 opacity-75">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-400 mb-1">5. Blue Links (Below the Fold)</h4>
        <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
          The traditional organic #1 you paid legacy agencies to rank now sits beneath four AI surfaces. Ranking there alone is no longer enough to win the customer.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>

</div>
